Facility Dashboard Platform\par
\par
Internal facility software. Installation registers the FacilityDashboards Windows service, provisions an inbound firewall rule for the configured listening port, and writes deploy-time configuration to the service folder.\par
\par
On a fresh database the installer creates the schema. On an existing database it never applies migrations automatically; use fd-dbtool after a backup, or pass APPLYMIGRATIONS=1 explicitly.\par
